ive. r=freddyb a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D167365", "files": ["dom/security/nsCSPContext.cpp", "dom/security/nsCSPContext.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "97abeba2f8979b913bc70154c126a5fa9337b4ad", "parents": ["d18c76d4040001112e4422edc8b54c60c1c79cc6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Schuster \u003ctschuster@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1790345 - ESR102: Strip cross-origin URIs in frame-src CSP reports. r=freddyb a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D167366\n\nDepends on D167365", "files": ["dom/security/nsCSPContext.cpp", "dom/security/test/csp/test_blocked_uri_in_violation_event_after_redirects.html", "dom/security/test/csp/test_blocked_uri_redirect_frame_src.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d4887cc8c4b99203f2f8f5a21ab46cd04305651f", "parents": ["97abeba2f8979b913bc70154c126a5fa9337b4ad"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1814251 - Update l10n-changesets on ESR102. r=flod\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D168471", "files": ["browser/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4fc0ca571dab7b1da2b40a5ec0c24d853015c47f", "parents": ["d4887cc8c4b99203f2f8f5a21ab46cd04305651f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dave Townsend \u003cdtownsend@oxymoronical.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1799632: Refactor `testOpenProto` to accept a callback to trigger protocol loads. r=Gijs, a=RyanVM\n\nCurrently this function uses six different booleans to decide which code to run\nto trigger the load (many of which are used in just one test) and elsewhere I\nneed to add more cases. This changes the function to instead take a callback\nfunction so individual tests can just pass their one-off functions. For the\nfew that are shared global functions are used to share those.\n\nDif